            "id": "https://iainsm.github.io/biocycle_test/machine-learning-assisted-design/",
            "url": "https://iainsm.github.io/biocycle_test/machine-learning-assisted-design/",
            "title": "Machine-learning Assisted Design",
            "summary": "One of our main goals is to expand the repertoire of enzymes&hellip;",
            "content_html": "\n  <p>\n    One of our main goals is to expand the repertoire of enzymes that can degrade plastics such as polystyrene. To generate and optimize new enzymes we will combine generative AI models to a high-throughput biological assay.\n  </p>\n\n    <figure class=\"post__image post__image--center\">\n      <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://iainsm.github.io/biocycle_test/media/posts/11/sample_figure1.png\" height=\"234\" width=\"230\" alt=\"\"  sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcset=\"https://iainsm.github.io/biocycle_test/media/posts/11/responsive/sample_figure1-xs.png 300w ,https://iainsm.github.io/biocycle_test/media/posts/11/responsive/sample_figure1-sm.png 480w ,https://iainsm.github.io/biocycle_test/media/posts/11/responsive/sample_figure1-md.png 768w ,https://iainsm.github.io/biocycle_test/media/posts/11/responsive/sample_figure1-lg.png 1024w\">\n      \n    </figure>\n\n  <p>\n    One of our main goals is to expand the repertoire of enzymes that can degrade plastics such as polystyrene. To generate and optimize new enzymes we will combine generative AI models to a high-throughput biological assay.\n  </p>\n\n  <p>\n    \n  </p>",
